<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Octodec interim headline unit up.</title>
<headline>Octodec interim headline unit up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Feb 28</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Linked unit, distrib  (cts) 24.97 vs 24.35</p>
<p>Linked unit, headline (cts) 24.76 vs 22.55</p>
<p>    Div (cts)			  0.48 vs  0.44</p>
<p>    Interest (cts)		  24.27 vs 22.06</p>
<p>    Distrib income		   0.43 vs  1.41</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			    0.63 vs  1.63</p>
<p>    Tax				  0.19 vs  0.22</p>
<p>    Interest paid		    1.14 vs  1.28</p>
<p>    Turnover			  22.21 vs 20.50</p>
<p>Div and interest payable May 21</p>
<p>on register April 25</p>
<p>Full name: Octodec Investments Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it anticiapted continued growth based on forecast additional rental income. It said it was confident of a further increase in the distribution to linked unit holders in the following financial period.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
